## Outline

### What happened

- `bls-empsit-schedule-2026-10-03`: published at 8:30 a.m. Eastern on October 2.
- `bls-empsit-2026-09`: payrolls +29,000 and unemployment 4.2 percent, both changed little.
- `bls-empsit-2026-09`: private +46,000 and government -17,000.
